Date: Fri, 9 Oct 2026 22:17:55 -0400
Subject: [PATCH] modules: Draw modules' HUD elements with the HUD

Modules' HUD elements (ADR 0046) are drawn after the HUD's first
stratum, before the chat, so in the browser they go into the HUD's
texture with the rest (ADR 0030).

diff --git a/src/main/java/net/minecraft/client/gui/Hud.java b/src/main/java/net/minecraft/client/gui/Hud.java
index cb09877416ec50e3613574bb0d4917ba985ae278..84977420997b886d87f219ccb7a1b6dbafdf76d9 100644
--- a/src/main/java/net/minecraft/client/gui/Hud.java
+++ b/src/main/java/net/minecraft/client/gui/Hud.java
@@ -242,2 +242,5 @@
                 // Incari end
+                // Incari start: modules' HUD elements
+                incari.client.modules.ModuleHud.extract(graphics);
+                // Incari end
                 this.extractChat(graphics, deltaTracker);
